:"source_location","html":"Buss and Turan, author manuscript February 1988, Theorem 1; manuscript/PDF pp. 3-6; inherited through 72-45"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"primary-source-supported-identity-summary; Haken-original-not-read"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"external_source","html":"<a href=\"https://mathweb.ucsd.edu/~sbuss/ResearchWeb/WPHP/paper.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://mathweb.ucsd.edu/~sbuss/ResearchWeb/WPHP/paper.pdf</a>"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-not-fully-checked; identity consequence of 72-45; inherits primary proof evidence restriction"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; inherited-primary-proof-scope-limited"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; inherited-primary-proof-scope-limited"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n\\)</span> 及其中由 Buss–Turán 一手证明支撑的强下界如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53a60483631f158b\" href=\"?note=53a60483631f158b\" title=\"72-thm-php-resolution-lower\">72-thm-php-resolution-lower</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}\">\\(\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq\\max(1,n_0)\\;\n\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq2^{cn}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq\\max(1,n_0)\\;\n\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq2^{cn}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53a60483631f158b\" href=\"?note=53a60483631f158b\" title=\"72-thm-php-resolution-lower\">72-thm-php-resolution-lower</a> 的同一强下界摘要；本次复核了恒等引用和行数度量，不作为独立来源计数。</li>\n<li>强结论现由该上游中的 Buss–Turán 一手 Theorem 1 及其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=n+1\">\\(m=n+1\\)</span> 特例推导支撑。Haken 原始论文全文未读的历史限制仍保留；不把 Handbook 的弱指数证明冒充为强下界证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-php-resolution-lower","status":"resolved","id":"53a60483631f158b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-php-resolution-lower","status":"resolved","id":"53a60483631f158b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n$ 及其中由 Buss–Turán 一手证明支撑的强下界如 [[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]；$\\omega$ 包含 $0$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-php-resolution-lower","status":"resolved","id":"53a60483631f158b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是 [[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]] 的同一强下界摘要；本次复核了恒等引用和行数度量，不作为独立来源计数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq\\max(1,n_0)\\;\n\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq2^{cn}.","display":true},{"tex":"m=n+1","display":false}],"bytes":1757,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-resolution-lower-bound|thm-resolution-lower-bound — Resolution Lower Bound]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-resolution-lower-bound|thm-resolution-lower-bound — Resolution Lower Bound]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-329","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-resolution-lower-bound|72-thm-resolution-lower-bound]]"}],"outgoing":["e585861c4ee3b135","53a60483631f158b"]}